OL,3,CJohnson & Johnson offers $5.5bn to
OL,4,Csettle US baby powder lawsuits
OL,6,FJohnson & Johnson (J&J) is willing to
OL,7,Fpay $5.5bn (#4.14bn) to settle tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of US lawsuits after claims
OL,9,Ftheir baby powder allegedly caused
OL,10,Fovarian cancer.
OL,12,FIt was claimed prolonged use of their
OL,13,Ftalc products, including baby products
OL,14,Fwere linked to cases of ovarian cancer.
OL,16,FThe medical company has denied all
OL,17,Fallegations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
