OL,3,CJohnson & Johnson offers $5.5bn to
OL,4,Csettle US baby powder lawsuits
OL,6,FOn Monday, J&J announced it will offer
OL,7,Fto settle the 76,000 claims against
OL,8,Fthe company, providing 95% of law
OL,9,Ffirms representing claimants accept
OL,10,Fthe proposal, in an attempt to end the
OL,11,F15-year litigation.
OL,13,FThe court previously ordered
OL,14,Fplaintiffs to show specific evidence
OL,15,Fwhy their claims could not be
OL,16,Fdismissed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
