OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785255527
OL,3,CJohnson & Johnson offers $5.5bn to
OL,4,Csettle US baby powder lawsuits
OL,6,FErik Haas, Worldwide Vice President of
OL,7,FLitigation at Johnson & Johnson said:
OL,8,F"These claims lack scientific merit
OL,9,Fand were sustained only by unreliable
OL,10,Fexpert opinions that could not survive
OL,11,Frigorous judicial review."
OL,13,FHe added, "this resolution allows the
OL,14,Fcompany to put this matter behind it
OL,15,Fand remain focused on its mission to
OL,16,Fdevelop medicines and devices that
OL,17,Fsave lives."
