OL,3,CJohnson & Johnson offers $5.5bn to
OL,4,Csettle US baby powder lawsuits
OL,6,FThe first payment of no more than $3bn
OL,7,F(#2.26bn) will be made next year, then
OL,8,Fthere will be no additional payments
OL,9,Funtil 2028.
OL,11,FTalc is a mineral made from magnesium,
OL,12,Fsilicon, oxygen, and hydrogen. It is
OL,13,Fground into a soapy fine dust and is
OL,14,Foften used to make makeup less oily
OL,15,Fand to prevent nappy rash on babies.
