OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785255527
OL,3,CJohnson & Johnson offers $5.5bn to
OL,4,Csettle US baby powder lawsuits
OL,6,FJ&J discontinued their talc-based
OL,7,FJohnson's baby powder globally in 2023.
OL,9,FGlobal consumer health company Kenvue,
OL,10,Fknown for brands like Calpol,
OL,11,FListerine and Aveeno, is liable for
OL,12,FJohnson's baby powder outside North
OL,13,FAmerica, after the company separated
OL,14,Fin 2023.
OL,16,FJ&J insist their talc is safe, does
OL,17,Fnot contain asbestos and does not
OL,18,Fcause cancer.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
